T1  - Investigating relationships between loneliness, social isolation and health.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/s41467-026-74758-7
A1  - Hilliard, Darren D
A1  - Wootton, Robyn E
A1  - Sallis, Hannah M
A1  - Van De Weijer, Margot P
