T1  - Prevalence of genital high-risk human papillomavirus infections and associated factors among women living with human immunodeficiency virus in Uganda.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s12885-024-11928-0
A1  - Nakigozi, Harriet
A1  - Ndejjo, Rawlance
A1  - Bazeyo, William
A1  - Nabaggala, Annet
A1  - Achola, Caroline
