T1  - Urbanization and depressive symptoms among middle-aged and older adults in China.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3389/fpubh.2022.1086248
A1  - Hong, Chenlu
A1  - Xiong, Xiaoxiao
A1  - Li, Jun
A1  - Ning, Xin
