T1  - [Analysis on reliability and validity of SF-36 scale in urban residents].
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3760/cma.j.issn.0254-6450.2016.03.010
A1  - Wang, Shan
A1  - Fan, Wenjie
A1  - Yu, Wanqi
